# dbt build artifacts must never be baked into the Linux image.
# walmart/target/partial_parse.msgpack is written by whichever OS runs dbt last
# and stores file ids built from OS-native path separators
# (walmart://macros\custom_schema.sql on Windows). A cache baked in from the
# Windows host makes the in-container Linux dbt raise
# KeyError: 'walmart://macros/custom_schema.sql' in load_and_parse_macros.
walmart/target/
walmart/logs/
